items.summary:
More questions than answers remain in the thwarted FlyDubai flight attack on the pilot, which luckily ended without a tragedy.
It remains unclear however whether it was:
A) Terrorist attack, and by whom;
B) Political attempt to poison the 🇦🇪UAE - Israel relations;
C) Lack of basic risk management by the airline in allowing an allegedly indoctrinated islamist as a pilot;
D) Evidence of the company’s poor treatment of employees, resulting in obvious depression, violence or suicidal issues;
E) Lack of security protocols allowing an easy use of the emergency “axe” as a weapon;
F) UAE authorities immediately trying to divert attention; a marketing spin was possibly launched by UAE - which is playing both sides in the 🇷🇺Russia-🇺🇦Ukraine war - to credit a mythical “Russian and Ukrainian pilots working together” for saving the day;
G) Other?

